1
00:00:00,585 --> 00:00:04,085
(Sheldon:)Fine. In the interest
of preserving our friendship...

2
00:00:04,297 --> 00:00:06,087
- We're not friends.
- Well...

3
00:00:06,299 --> 00:00:09,299
(Sheldon:)...that's a little hard to hear,
but all right.

4
00:00:09,511 --> 00:00:13,851
(Sheldon:)As you know, the essence of diplomacy
is compromise.

5
00:00:14,057 --> 00:00:16,597
(Sheldon:)With that in mind,
l propose the following.

6
00:00:16,810 --> 00:00:19,310
l will take Rothman's office...

7
00:00:19,521 --> 00:00:23,441
(Sheldon:)...and you will find a way
to be okay with that.

8
00:00:25,026 --> 00:00:29,696
How about I take Rothman's office
and you go suck a lemon?

9
00:00:36,830 --> 00:00:38,960
(Sheldon:)You sure I can't get you
that cup of tea?

10
00:00:39,666 --> 00:00:44,376
(Raj:)How about you decide this with
Rock, Paper, Scissors, Lizard, Spock?

11
00:00:45,672 --> 00:00:47,092
What the frig is that?

12
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:50,130
Rock, Paper, Scissors, Lizard, Spock...

13
00:00:50,343 --> 00:00:52,843
...was created by lnternet pioneer
Sam Kass...

14
00:00:53,054 --> 00:00:55,684
(Sheldon:)...as an improvement
on the game Rock, Paper, Scissors.

15
00:00:55,891 --> 00:00:57,061
(Sheldon:)All hail Sam Kass.

16
00:00:57,267 --> 00:01:00,027
(Sheldon:)Hail.

